                        <h3>Uski Sabse Pyaari Cheez 🌸</h3>
                        <p>Lovie, tumhari thinking, tumhara behaviour aur tumhara sabki help karne ka tareeka mere dil ko chhu jata hai[cite: 1]. Aur haan, jab tum gusse me kehti ho na—"Mar khani hai kya mujhse, dar nhi lagta aap ko"—wo mujhe sabse zyaada pyaara lagta hai[cite: 1]. Aur phir jab tum utne hi pyaar se bolti ho "I love you mera baccha", toh mera poora din ban jata hai!</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-card glowing-box">
                        <h3>Favorite Memories 📝</h3>
                        <p>Wo pal main kabhi nahi bhool sakta jab tumne itni fikr me kaha tha ki "Mujhe laga aapne block kar diya aur sachi me aakho me aasu aa gae"[cite: 1]. Tumhara wo haq jatana, dher saari reels share karke sath me hasna, raat-raat bhar jaag kar baatein karna[cite: 1], baat-baat par poochna ki "Kha gaye the ya kha ja rhe ho"[cite: 1], aur kabhi-kabhi bachhon ki tarah meri hi baaton ko same repeat karna—meri zindgi ki sabse haseen aur pyaari yaadein hain!</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-card glowing-box">
                        <h3>My Promise To Her 🤝</h3>
                        <p>Main tumse wada karta hoon ki tum chahe kitni bhi raat ko call karo, main kabhi gussa nahi hoonga aur humesha call uthaunga[cite: 1]. Plant me rahoon ya kahin bhi[cite: 1], jab bhi tum pareshan hogi, main sab chhod kar sabse pehle apni jaan ki baat sununga[cite: 1]. Lovie, tum mere liye sabse zyada special ho, tum meri jaan ho aur main tumhe kabhi nahi chhodunga. Yeh wada ek sacche mard ka hai jo zindagi bhar tumhara hath thaam kar chalega!</p>
